    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Ding goes the storybook timer—our picture baking day begins.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "A to Z comes rolling in with breads, cakes, and swirls.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "A—Apple Pie! Apple Pie on display | crust, fold, swirl, or shape gives the clue today",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "B ... B ... Brownie. A brownie is a dense flat chocolate cake-bar often cut into squares or rectangles.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Cookie steps in for C. It is a small flat baked item whose outline and surface texture make clear picture clues.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "What does D reveal? Donut! A donut is a fried or baked dough treat often shaped as a ring or filled round.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "through the storybook baking-day window, E meets Eclair. Eclair on display | crust, fold, swirl, or shape gives the clue today",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "F—Frosting! It is a thick spreadable topping that can form swirls or smooth layers on cakes.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "G ... G ... Gingerbread. Gingerbread can be baked as a loaf, cake, or shaped cookie; its brown spiced crumb and outline are useful picture clues.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Honey Bun steps in for H. It is a soft coiled or rolled sweet bun often finished with a thin glaze.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Storybook baking—one-two-three!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Bread and cake words, A to Z!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "What does I reveal? Icing! Icing on top | texture, dots, or shine make the picture pop",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "through the storybook baking-day window, J meets Jelly Donut. It is a filled round donut with fruit jelly or jam inside.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "K—Kolache! It is a small yeasted pastry with a visible center or enclosed filling, depending on style.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "L ... L ... Lemon Tart. A lemon tart has a pastry shell filled with a smooth lemon filling.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Muffin steps in for M. Muffin in our sight | layer, crumb, or topping gives the clue just right",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "What does N reveal? Nut Bread! Nut bread is a loaf with visible nut pieces mixed through the crumb.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "through the storybook baking-day window, O meets Orange Cake. It is a cake whose sponge or topping is flavored with orange; layers, crumb, and citrus decoration are visual clues.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "P—Pie! It has a pastry crust holding a filling, sometimes with a top crust or decorative edge.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Q ... Queen Cake. Queen Cake on display | crumb and layers give its shape away",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Raisin Bread steps in for R. It is a loaf with visible raisins dotted through the crumb.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "What does S reveal? Sprinkles! Sprinkles are tiny decorative pieces scattered over frosting, icing, or other surfaces.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "through the storybook baking-day window, T meets Tart. It has a shallow pastry shell with an open filling visible on top.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-5-1",
