      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "through the storybook baking-day window, Y meets Yule Log. Yule Log in our sight | layer, crumb, or topping gives the clue just right",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Z—Zucchini Bread! It is a quick-bread loaf with a crust outside and soft crumb containing grated zucchini.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
